      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Rules:** Full 2h+ (too late) = full (≥ 98 %) for 2+ site hours before the lift · <60% (too early) = emptied more than 20 points below the on-call level (80 %) · otherwise ≥60% (on time). The lift-model verdicts (trained on the Europress history) are shown as a second opinion on the *Site now* page."
